   3: // Failure cases: a worker takes work for another worker's agent, or the same work twice; a lost answer to a claim loses the
   4: // work (the same claim must get it back) or hands it out twice; events arriving while work waits make more runs instead of
   5: // joining it; work in a group starts while another in it is still running; a parallel rule puts two subjects in one run,
